# Cloudflare static-asset headers. CSS/JS are versioned with ?v= (docs/tools/stamp_assets.py),
# so they can be cached for a year. When you REPLACE an image, give it a NEW file name.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/quote/vendor/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/quote/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
